<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E JAN GROUP NET UP TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E JAN GROUP NET UP TO PLN 3.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.99 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.99 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.02 vs   0.26 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    2.06 vs   1.86</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3.21 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 3.71 vs   3.09</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.93 vs   0.54</p>
<p> Group sales		   30.67 vs  26.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction and trading company</p>
<p>is Mostostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
